; In-client data miner (the uespLog approach): abilities, items (via
; synthesized links, which also yield enchant names), champion skills, scribing
; scripts, Vengeance perks, skill lines and item sets, in the client's language.
; Not part of the Battle Scrolls addon - install separately.
; Run /bsabilitydump passes across languages/classes, /reloadui to persist, then run
; scripts/import-abilities.sh from the repo.

